{{ModBox}}
'''Seismic Bond''' is a [[Companion]] [[mod]] that causes the companion's melee attacks to emit 4-meter shockwaves, as long as a [[Channeled Abilities|Channeled Ability]] is active. In addition, the companion's attacks will grant stacking [[Ability Efficiency]] to their owner for a brief period.

