==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[Son]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Associate''' with the [[Entrati]].

==Notes==
*A channeled ability must be active for both the shockwave to trigger and to gain stacks of the Ability Efficiency bonus.
**Stacks are gained on any damage dealt by your companion. Each stack has its own duration.
**"Channeled abilities" that trigger Seismic Bond are the same abilities that triggers {{Arcane|Arcane Intention}}. See list below.
*Shockwave deals {{D|Impact}} Damage and has a '''0% Status Chance'''.
**Damage scales with increases to melee damage (e.g. {{M|Precision Conditioning}}), but is unaffected by damage conversion and elemental damage bonuses.
**Shockwave does not hit enemies protected with [[Overguard]].
**Status Chance can be added to with {{M|Mecha Overdrive}} to create {{D|Impact}} procs.
**Shockwave can applies Status Effects via {{M|Manifold Bond}}.
**Shockwave does '''not''' trigger {{M|Vicious Bond}}.
*Ability Efficiency bonus is additive to similar bonuses such as {{M|Streamline}}.
**A channeled ability does '''not''' have to be active to gain the Ability Efficiency bonus of existing stacks.
**Testing with {{WF|Hildryn}}'s {{A|Balefire}} has shown that it [[Snapshotting|snapshots]] Ability Efficiency on cast.
**Testing with {{WF|Mesa}}'s {{A|Peacemaker}} has shown that it updates its energy consumption according to Ability Efficiency dynamically.

